at I l{{F}}ove, and the s{{G}}tories I've{{Am}} told\n Ce que{{F}} j'imagine{{C}} et ce que{{F}} je cro{{G}}is\n \n \n I can m{{Am}}ake you feel g{{F}}ood even whe{{G}}n I'm do{{C}}wn\n Les ra{{Am}}isons qui me {{F}}portent et ce s{{G}}tupide{{C}} espoir\n My force is a p{{F}}latform that{{G}} you can clim{{Am}}b on\n Une épau{{F}}le fragi{{C}}le et forte {{F}}à la f{{G}}ois\n \n \n Je te {{C}}donn{{F}}e, o{{Am}}ui,\n je te {{F}}donn{{C}}e__ {{G}}tout{{Am}} ce que je va{{F}}ux , ce que {{C}}je suis, mes {{G}}dons,\n Mes défa{{Am}}uts, mes p{{F}}lus belles c{{C}}hances, mes d{{F}}iffére{{G}}nces (3x, Ab Litum)\n \n \n\n>>>>8888888b.  888      d8b 888         .d8888b.  888                           888\n>>>>888   Y88b 888      Y8P 888         d88P  Y88b 888                           888\n>>>>888    888 888          888         888    888 888                           888\n>>>>888   d88P 88888b.  888 888         888        88888b.   .d88b.  888d888 .d88888 .d8888b\n>>>>8888888P\"  888 \"88b 888 888         888        888 \"88b d88\"\"88b 888P\"  d88\" 888 88K\n>>>>888        888  888 888 888         888    888 888  888 888  888 888    888  888 \"Y8888b.\n>>>>888        888  888 888 888   888   Y88b  d88P 888  888 Y88..88P 888    Y88b 888      X88\n>>>>888        888  888 888 888   888    \"Y8888P\"  888  888  \"Y88P\"  888     \"Y88888  88888P",
